      ":question/problem": "![](images/a1/a1a473866bda1ff757f239a816c35c87907fbd375c50d1a3127dec08c73fbfd6.png)\n\nIn the diagram above, the parallel lines $l$ and $m$ are crossed by the transversal $t$.\n\nConsider the following statement:\n\n> *The angles $\u22204$ and $\u22208$ are congruent.*\n\nThe table below gives the proof of the statement. Select the correct options in the table and thus complete the proof.\n\n|  | Statement | Reason |\n| --- | ---: | ---: |\n| 1 | $\u22204\u2245\u22206$ | {{field-1}} |\n| 2 | $\u22206\u2245\u22208$ | {{field-2}} |\n| 3 | {{field-3}} | Transitive property of congruence |"
